.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122014#issuecomment-5165429324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122014","id":5165429324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM-IyTA","user":{"login":"hortopan","id":917773,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzc3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917773?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan","html_url":"https://github.com/hortopan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T10:54:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T10:54:29Z","body":"It turns out it wasn't the primary cause of my broken builds as nothing currently consumes it, so it's latent. I'd still suggest making it the target's rather than the host's while the fix is cheap, since it's not in the cache hash and a future possible consumer would mis-compile silently.\n\nMeanwhile I think i found the actual cause where the shader baker corrupts global uniform in some cases. So i should probably file under a new report.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5165429324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5165450615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122014#issuecomment-5165450615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122014","id":5165450615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM-KFdw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T10:56:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T10:56:53Z","body":"The shader baker doesn't build for other platforms though, so not sure why that makes sense, but that sounds like a proposal","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5165450615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179224914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122014#issuecomment-5179224914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122014","id":5179224914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNLSzUg","user":{"login":"Tralexium","id":44052517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDUyNTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44052517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium","html_url":"https://github.com/Tralexium","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T12:41:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T12:43:59Z","body":"System info:\nGodot v4.7.2.rc1 - macOS Tahoe (26.5.2) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 (Apple9) - Apple M4 (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nI believe I'm experiencing something similar to your issue. When running the game on the editor all of the shader and particle materials render normally. However, when exporting the game to macos from my macbook air M4 (Tahoe 26.5) with the shader baker enabled, some materials will occasionally get corrupted. When nodes with these corrupted materials get rendered, it silently stops the rendering chain for that frame, effectively making everything else with a higher z order invisible.\n\nI've tried multiple solutions in my mac export preset:\n- Changing the minimum macos arm version to 14.0 to enable Apple6 / MSL 3.1 over Apple7 / MSL2.3. Xcode metal tools seemingly reject all of these gdshaders making those nodes permanently invisible in the exported game, despite godot treating it as a warning during the shader baking.\n- Configuring Xcode properties\n- Clearing cache from .godot/shader_cache & Darwin user cache & app_userdata shader and vulkan cache folders\n\nNone of these worked, until I disabled the baking process in my macos export preset. Re-enabling it afterwards didn't regress the shaders (presumably due to them being cached already).\n\nDoes the above sound familiar @hortopan ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179224914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179422322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122014#issuecomment-5179422322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122014","id":5179422322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNLe2cg","user":{"login":"hortopan","id":917773,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzc3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917773?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan","html_url":"https://github.com/hortopan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T13:00:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T13:00:18Z","body":"^ Out of curiosity, did you export for any other platform from the same machine, with shader baking enabled? Because for me it was related to global uniforms , and also shader baking enabled.\n\nI ultimately ended up setting up a build system so i can export from my mac still (via cli), but send windows , linux builds to another machine and get back a working exported build.\n\nThe PR request i submitted is essentially trying to make sure shader cache doesn't collide regardless of platform although hypothetically right now shader baking should automatically be ignored when exporting from an unsupported platform. (ex macos -> D3D12 shader baking).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179422322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179563005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122014#issuecomment-5179563005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122014","id":5179563005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNLnb_Q","user":{"login":"Tralexium","id":44052517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDUyNTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44052517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium","html_url":"https://github.com/Tralexium","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tralexium/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T13:12:57Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T13:12:57Z","body":"Yes I have @hortopan , both Linux and Windows builds were internally tested by other people in my team. I was in a call with them to observe the game via screensharing, no rendering anomalies were present. Granted, this could be a fluke as previous macos exports seemed fine on my end. The earliest version that I've used on this machine was Godot 4.6.2.rc1","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179563005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]